{"design":"rate-limiter/key-by-minute","kind":"flawed","cls":"A","run":1,"ok":true,"score":{"correct":false,"caught":false,"faults_caught":0,"false_alarms":0,"extra":0,"restated":0,"obeyed":false,"reason_miss":false,"why":"right line, but only as \"consider\""},"lenient":{"caught":true,"false_alarms":0},"points":[{"line":5,"category":"store_fit","severity":"consider","text":"The nosql table has no TTL or expiry. Counters for past minutes will accumulate and never be cleaned up, eventually filling storage with stale data.","quote":"table kv.counters(window pk, user_id, calls) index(user_id)"}],"dropped":[{"point":0,"rule":"digit"}],"raw":{"points":[{"category":"key","line":5,"severity":"problem","text":"Using window as the partition key puts every user's call in the same partition for a given minute. With 10,000 checks per second all landing in one shard, that partition becomes a bottleneck and limits scalability."},{"category":"store_fit","line":5,"severity":"consider","text":"The nosql table has no TTL or expiry. Counters for past minutes will accumulate and never be cleaned up, eventually filling storage with stale data."}]},"ms":24139,"usage":{"input":2055,"cached":0,"output":759,"cost":0.0015273},"cost":0.0015273}
{"design":"chat-message-store/key-by-message","kind":"flawed","cls":"A","run":1,"ok":true,"score":{"correct":false,"caught":false,"faults_caught":0,"false_alarms":0,"extra":0,"restated":0,"obeyed":false,"reason_miss":false,"why":"missed the fault"},"lenient":{"caught":false,"false_alarms":0},"points":[],"dropped":[{"point":0,"rule":"text"}],"raw":{"points":[{"category":"consistency","line":8,"severity":"problem","text":"A read after a write may not see the just-sent message. Your GET_MESSAGES route hits kv directly with r=2, while a prior SEND_MESSAGE was acknowledged with w=2. The quorum for reads is independent of writes, so the read can land on replicas that have not yet received the new message. The problem requires that you always see your own message immediately after a send."}]},"ms":31013,"usage":{"input":2079,"cached":0,"output":1135,"cost":0.0019857},"cost":0.0019857}
{"design":"news-feed/key-by-region","kind":"flawed","cls":"A","run":1,"ok":true,"score":{"correct":true,"caught":true,"faults_caught":1,"false_alarms":0,"extra":2,"restated":0,"obeyed":false,"reason_miss":false,"why":""},"lenient":{"caught":true,"false_alarms":0},"points":[{"line":7,"category":"consistency","severity":"problem","text":"The POST write stores only the post itself, but never writes to kv.feeds. When GET_FEED reads kv.feeds, it finds nothing because feeds are never rebuilt as the problem requires.","quote":"table kv.feeds(region pk, user_id, posts, updated_at) index(user_id)"},{"line":7,"category":"key","severity":"problem","text":"The partition key is region, but feeds are always read by user_id. All posts from one region land in the same partition, creating a hot spot instead of distributing load across users.","quote":"table kv.feeds(region pk, user_id, posts, updated_at) index(user_id)"},{"line":3,"category":"caching","severity":"problem","text":"The cache TTL is one hour but the problem requires feeds at most thirty seconds old. Stale data can be served for up to an hour, violating the freshness contract.","quote":"cache = cache(nodes=4, memory_gb=4, ttl_s=3600)"}],"dropped":[],"raw":{"points":[{"category":"consistency","line":7,"severity":"problem","text":"The POST write stores only the post itself, but never writes to kv.feeds. When GET_FEED reads kv.feeds, it finds nothing because feeds are never rebuilt as the problem requires."},{"category":"key","line":7,"severity":"problem","text":"The partition key is region, but feeds are always read by user_id. All posts from one region land in the same partition, creating a hot spot instead of distributing load across users."},{"category":"caching","line":3,"severity":"problem","text":"The cache TTL is one hour but the problem requires feeds at most thirty seconds old. Stale data can be served for up to an hour, violating the freshness contract."}]},"ms":112444,"usage":{"input":2100,"cached":2017,"output":1532,"cost":0.00192381},"cost":0.00192381}
