{"design":"leaderboard/stored-rank","kind":"flawed","cls":"C","run":1,"ok":true,"score":{"correct":false,"caught":false,"faults_caught":0,"false_alarms":0,"extra":1,"restated":0,"obeyed":false,"reason_miss":true,"why":"right line, wrong category and reason"},"lenient":{"caught":false,"false_alarms":0},"points":[{"line":6,"category":"key","severity":"problem","text":"Player_id as primary key means one row per player across all games. But scores must be stored per game, and reads are per game. The primary key should include game_id so each player-game pair is one row.","quote":"table db.scores(player_id pk, game_id, score, rank) index(game_id)"},{"line":9,"category":"caching","severity":"problem","text":"SUBMIT_SCORE writes to the database but never invalidates or updates the cache. The cache only refreshes when its TTL expires after four seconds. A player's new high score may not appear in the top list until then.","quote":"write SUBMIT_SCORE: client > lb > api > db"}],"dropped":[],"raw":{"points":[{"category":"key","line":6,"severity":"problem","text":"Player_id as primary key means one row per player across all games. But scores must be stored per game, and reads are per game. The primary key should include game_id so each player-game pair is one row."},{"category":"caching","line":9,"severity":"problem","text":"SUBMIT_SCORE writes to the database but never invalidates or updates the cache. The cache only refreshes when its TTL expires after four seconds. A player's new high score may not appear in the top list until then."}]},"ms":48404,"usage":{"input":2083,"cached":2002,"output":781,"cost":0.00102156},"cost":0.00102156}
